WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.333
- Will any player ever match me?

00:00:02.333 --> 00:00:03.958
Well, he would have to be some sort of freak.

00:00:03.958 --> 00:00:06.083
Huh? Whoo!
- Ohh.

00:00:07.375 --> 00:00:11.125
- Is this the moon? Of course I'd win the space race.

00:00:11.125 --> 00:00:14.791
- [Old-school announcer:] Welcome to an arena not only 
of sight and sound, but of mind.

00:00:14.791 --> 00:00:21.000
On one side, fresh off his 100-point game: 
1962 Wilt Chamberlain.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:25.416
- [Modern announcer:] Versus the Greek Freak himself: 
2021 Giannis Antetokounmpo.

00:00:25.416 --> 00:00:28.625
- Wow, was that a wormhole? God bless America, man.

00:00:28.625 --> 00:00:32.083
- So, they had to get a guy from the future to challenge me?

00:00:32.083 --> 00:00:33.250
[chuckles]

00:00:35.541 --> 00:00:38.291
- [Old-school announcer:] And Wilt's on pace to beat 
his 100-point record.

00:00:38.291 --> 00:00:41.166
- I have so many questions. 20,000?

00:00:42.166 --> 00:00:45.041
- [Old-school announcer:] Wilt to the rack...he throws it down!

00:00:45.041 --> 00:00:47.250
Wilt is just too dominant.

00:00:47.250 --> 00:00:49.791
- You can't stop the best scorer of all time.

00:00:49.791 --> 00:00:52.458
- Actually, I think it's Jordan for average and Kareem for total.

00:00:52.458 --> 00:00:54.791
- I don't care who those suckers are, I could play in any era.

00:00:56.666 --> 00:00:59.250
- Maybe we could update the court then?
- [Modern announcer:] Oh, thank God.

00:01:03.958 --> 00:01:06.250
Get this man some kicks so he doesn't look like a hipster!

00:01:06.250 --> 00:01:08.000
- Whoa, you copped.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:09.833
- Wh...wh...what the hell is this?

00:01:09.833 --> 00:01:11.083
- Sorry, sir.

00:01:11.083 --> 00:01:12.583
Learning new things is hard.

00:01:12.583 --> 00:01:16.250
You know each American city has its own type of pizza?
That's so many types!

00:01:16.250 --> 00:01:17.125
My turn!

00:01:17.625 --> 00:01:21.750
- [Modern announcer:] Giannis with the spin. Ooh, baby, 
he's too clean!

00:01:23.500 --> 00:01:25.875
- [Old-school announcer:] Unbelievable.

00:01:25.875 --> 00:01:29.875
- [Modern announcer:] Ay, Giannis is a cheat code, finishing with a filthy Eurostep.

00:01:29.875 --> 00:01:31.583
- Aha! A communist.

00:01:31.583 --> 00:01:33.250
- [Old-school announcer:] From way downtown!

00:01:33.250 --> 00:01:36.625
Wilt collects the rebound...now driving the baseline
...and he slams it home!

00:01:36.625 --> 00:01:39.666
- Game point. I am the best at everything.

00:01:39.666 --> 00:01:41.791
- [Old-school announcer:] Oh, foul. Wilt to the line.

00:01:44.041 --> 00:01:45.916
- It's my only weakness, OK?

00:01:45.916 --> 00:01:48.833
- The trick to foul shots is to take forever.

00:01:49.291 --> 00:01:49.791
You'll get it.

00:01:49.791 --> 00:01:51.333
- [Old-school announcer:] And Wilt finally plays some D.

00:01:51.333 --> 00:01:55.416
- Amazing block, man! Oh, sorry, foul again.

00:01:55.416 --> 00:01:56.541
You got it this time.

00:01:56.541 --> 00:01:58.791
- [Modern announcer:] Giannis so humble. God, we all love him.

00:01:58.791 --> 00:02:01.916
- Humble...being humble works?

00:02:01.916 --> 00:02:06.041
- [Modern announcer:] And Wilt is shooting granny style?!
Ugh, this is cringe, just take the L.

00:02:06.041 --> 00:02:08.000
- [Old-school announcer:] Yeah, he's no hero of mine anymore.

00:02:08.833 --> 00:02:11.416
- [Chamberlain:] God, I hope Bill Russell ain't watching this.

00:02:13.500 --> 00:02:17.291
- [Old-school announcer:] And Wilt wins with what I think is a career-low 11 points!

00:02:17.750 --> 00:02:22.333
- It's hard for a man like me to say this, but thank you.
I will never forget you.

00:02:22.333 --> 00:02:23.583
- No, it was my pleas-

00:02:23.583 --> 00:02:25.250
- I'm talkin' to the shoes.

00:02:32.875 --> 00:02:37.041
- Yeah, this is a fine matchup, but
what about MJ vs. LeBron?

00:02:37.041 --> 00:02:39.208
- Portalcorn here, get your portalcorn!

00:02:39.208 --> 00:02:40.458
- Ooh, ooh! Get us some!

00:02:40.458 --> 00:02:41.583
- Yo, how much for a quark?

00:02:41.583 --> 00:02:43.250
- Uh, a billion parsecs.

00:02:43.250 --> 00:02:44.416
- This is damn highway robbery.

00:02:44.416 --> 00:02:46.875
You know, this is why people just subscribe
below and don't come to the game.

00:02:46.875 --> 00:02:48.541
- Trying to make a living, buddy!

